    "Son cambios grandes que Relevo no hace sin preguntarte. Lo que se borre va a la papelera de Relevo y queda ahí un tiempo.": "These are big changes Relevo won't make without asking. Anything deleted goes to Relevo's trash and stays there for a while.",
    "Ya no están en el %@ (las borraste o las moviste). Si seguís, también se sacan del %@: van a la papelera de Relevo de ese disco y quedan %ld días por si te arrepentís.": "They're no longer on the %@ (you deleted or moved them). If you continue, they're also removed from the %@: they go to that drive's Relevo trash and stay %ld days in case you change your mind.",
