    "“Ahora no” no toca nada. Si no respondés, se aplican solos el %@ (lo borrado queda en la papelera de Relevo).": "“Not now” doesn't touch anything. If you don't answer, they're applied automatically on %@ (what's deleted stays in Relevo's trash).",
