    "Sí": "Yes",
    "Ya hay una clave guardada para un disco con este mismo identificador, y este aparece sin cifrar. No cifré nada para no perder esa clave. Si descifraste el disco a propósito, borrá su clave en la app Llaves y volvé a intentarlo.": "A key is already saved for a drive with this same identifier, and this one shows as unencrypted. I didn't encrypt anything so that key isn't lost. If you decrypted the drive on purpose, delete its key in the Passwords app and try again.",
    "El disco que dice ser tu portátil aparece sin cifrar, pero tu portátil está cifrado. No copio nada a ese disco. Si lo descifraste vos a propósito, borrá su clave en la app Llaves.": "The drive claiming to be your portable drive shows as unencrypted, but your portable drive is encrypted. I'm not copying anything to it. If you decrypted it on purpose, delete its key in the Passwords app.",
